---

**Recipe provenance (template behaviour).** Commands are real
invocation shapes. Expected output is a shape with placeholders, never
an invented transcript. An unfinished step renders as an explicit
`PENDING` marker. The provenance footnote uses the guide's compact
form:

ref: [{{TOOL_VERSION}}]({{PIN_SOURCE_URL}}) - verified {{VERIFIED_AT}}

(plus, only when true, a one-line smoke/missing-surface note with its
link). A recipe goes stale when a named tool's pin moves and no
re-work follows. Update the stale recipe in the same change.
